// ============================================================================
// Optimized tiled GEMM for NVIDIA Ampere (sm_86, A40)
//
// Block:  TX=16, TY=16  => 256 threads
// Tile:   64x64 output tile per block
// K-tile: 64 (1 K-split = 1 sync per block!)
// Register tile: TM=4, TN=4 (each thread computes 16 output elements)
//
// Shared memory: As[TK][TG+1], Bs[TK][TG+1] with 1-element padding
//
// Each thread: TM*TN*TK = 4*4*64 = 1024 MACs per block, only 1 sync!
// Total: 256 threads * 1024 MACs = 262144 MACs = 64*64*64 (correct!)
